{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hi, I'm a indie single developer, I hope you enjoy your game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200bEva Platformer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the game Eva Platformer! In this game you will take on the role of the heroine Eva, who goes on an exciting journey through bright and colorful worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to collect coins and keys to open new levels and overcome various obstacles on the way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/a4786a858c9dfdbc430937c925672a3c.poster.avif?t=1764937733\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/a4786a858c9dfdbc430937c925672a3c.webm?t=1764937733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/a4786a858c9dfdbc430937c925672a3c.mp4?t=1764937733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting Coins: Each level has dozens of gold coins waiting for you to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding Keys: Keys are the main element needed to pass the game. You can use them to open doors to the next location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels: The game features several different levels, each offering unique locations.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obstacles and enemies: On Eva's path you will encounter enemies. Use jump and attack to destroy them and reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/128ebf353699dc6b3f1b807b4ce7a9ed.poster.avif?t=1764937733\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/128ebf353699dc6b3f1b807b4ce7a9ed.webm?t=1764937733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/128ebf353699dc6b3f1b807b4ce7a9ed.mp4?t=1764937733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help Eva collect all the coins and keys to open the door to an exciting world of adventure! Join Eva Platformer game and prove that you are a real platformer lover!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/0e9c2ffe664401c76fe08032de8136cd.poster.avif?t=1764937733\" width=612 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/0e9c2ffe664401c76fe08032de8136cd.webm?t=1764937733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176450/extras/0e9c2ffe664401c76fe08032de8136cd.mp4?t=1764937733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level 1 Perfect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3176450/53cd2e02ef097353dadc42e7c520a0372295e2fd.jpg"},{"name":"Level 2 Perfect Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3176450/06f8e386ec636304fe84b370327a7dda8d0efa26.jpg"},{"name":"Level 3 Perfect Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3176450/ff2bc4cee00ac8a40222dc846c95e9bcb4a038c8.jpg"},{"name":"Level 4 Perfect C